# Theme (`themes/omid-dev`)

Follow `AGENTS.md` for project context. Product anti-references and brand constraints: `PRODUCT.md`. Design system: [`DESIGN.md`](../../DESIGN.md) (tokens, layers, primitives).

- Layouts: Go templates in `layouts/`; extend partials rather than duplicating markup.
- CSS: modular files under `assets/css/`; use tokens from `core/` and existing components.
- i18n: string files in `i18n/*.yaml` for all three languages when adding UI text.
- RTL: test `fa` layout when changing navigation, prose, or flex/grid styles.
- Shortcodes: add or edit in `layouts/shortcodes/` (`companion` for playground demos; `tool` for installable scripts under `/tools/`).
- Tools catalog: `layouts/_default/tools.html` (index), `tool.html` (README page), `partials/tools_card.html`; styles in `assets/css/pages/tools.css`. Keep Tools in the **pages** sitemap when changing sitemap partials (`single.sitemappageslang.xml`, `partials/sitemap/lang-pages.html`).
- After changes, run `hugo --minify` and fix template errors before finishing.
